# 7.9 Data Protection

### Audit Objectives

Determine whether sensitive information is properly protected.

### Areas to Review

* Data classification.
* Encryption.
* Data access.
* Data sharing.
* Data retention.
* Secure deletion.
* Sensitive information handling.

