# 7.11 Incident Response

### Audit Objectives

Determine whether the organization can effectively respond to cybersecurity incidents.

### Areas to Review

* Incident response plan.
* Incident reporting.
* Response roles.
* Escalation procedures.
* Evidence preservation.
* Communication procedures.
* Incident exercises.
