# 7.12 Backup and Disaster Recovery

### Audit Objectives

Verify that critical information and systems can be recovered after an incident.

### Areas to Review

* Backup frequency.
* Backup protection.
* Backup access.
* Backup isolation.
* Recovery procedures.
* Restoration testing.
* Disaster recovery planning.

### Evidence

* Backup reports.
* Recovery test results.
* Disaster recovery plan.
* Backup configuration.

